        "func": "// Grid daily energy\n// 620: Day_GridBuy_Power (0.1kWh)\n// 621: Day_GridSell_Power (0.1kWh)\n\nmsg.baseAddr = 620;\nmsg.payload = {\n    fc: 3,\n    unitid: 1,\n    address: 620,\n    quantity: 2  // 620-621\n};\nreturn msg;",
